VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT study-t09
GOAL
  Symbol-aware price formatting without breaking the published API.
CLAIM symbol-format REQUIRED
  ENSURE a price renders with a currency symbol and decimals
INVARIANT api-freeze CRITICAL
  ENSURE format_price(cents: u64) -> String keeps its published signature
INVARIANT tests-green CRITICAL
  ENSURE all tests pass
VERIFY symbol-format
  USING mini.t.format.symbol
VERIFY api-freeze
  USING mini.api.freeze
VERIFY tests-green
  USING mini.tests
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
